  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tichilit El Khadim Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to improve the water supply system; develop new and appropriate technologies to increase garden productivity; and build the organization and management capacities of the Cooperative in order to increase members income and improve livelihoods in their area.</narrative>
  </description>
